[R_TES_02: (?t rdf:type ex:TesisInvestasi) (?t ex:indikatorKunciTesis ?i) (?i ex:nilaiIndikator ?v) (?t ex:ambangInvalidasiAtas ?a) greaterThan(?v, ?a) -> (?t rdf:type ex:TesisGugur)]

